Source: haltia-music
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Haltia <rensomail@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), unzip, wget, ca-certificates
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/haltia-de/music
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: haltia-music
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-secret-1,
 python3-haltia-kit (>= 2.3.0), python3-mpv, python3-aiohttp, python3-aiofiles,
 python3-yarl, python3-requests, python3-typing-extensions, python3-qrcode
Recommends: python3-cryptography, python3-orjson, python3-zeroconf
Description: Yandex Music and Music Assistant, with radio, collections and search
 Музыка (Music) plays Яндекс Музыка: Моя волна and its modes, one's
 collection, the chart, new releases and picks, and finds tracks and
 playlists. It also plays from a Music Assistant server of one's own, as one
 of its players. It keeps playing behind other windows, and shows what
 plays in the desktop's player controls. Part of Haltia, a calm touch
 desktop; it runs on any GTK desktop.
 .
 The yandex-music, ya-passport-auth, aiosendspin, cpace, noiseprotocol and
 mashumaro libraries, which the distribution lacks, come inside the
 package. Music Assistant needs the recommended packages (on Ubuntu 24.04,
 which has no python3-orjson, use the Flatpak for it).
